@@ -1,11 +1,11 @@
 name: 3dtrees_smart_tile
 owner: bgruening
-description: Subsampling, tiling, merging and matching of (multiple) point clouds.
-homepage_url: https://github.com/3dTrees-earth/3Dtrees_smart_tile
+description: Tile, filter, merge and remap LiDAR predictions and create merged products.
+homepage_url: https://github.com/3dTrees-earth/3dtrees_Smart_Tile
 long_description: |
-  This tool processes 3D point cloud data for tree segmentation by either:
-  - Tiling: Subsampling the input point cloud and creating tiles for processing
-  - Merging: Merging processed tiles back into the original point cloud resolution
+  SmartTile prepares spatial or whole-instance point-cloud tiles, filters
+  and merges segmented tiles, remaps predictions onto the originals, and
+  creates full-resolution or subsampled LAZ, COPC LAZ and PLY products.
 remote_repository_url: https://github.com/bgruening/galaxytools/tree/master/tools/3dtrees_smart_tile
 type: unrestricted
 categories:
